  "project_description": "WebProfiler adds a toolbar at the bottom of every page and shows you various stats, such as the number of database queries loaded on the page, which services are used, and more.\n\n Due to changes in the underlying version of Symfony between Drupal 9, 10, and Drupal 11, you have to choose the correct version of this module. Version 9.x is compatible with Drupal 9 (and the unsupported Drupal 8). Version 10.x is compatible with Drupal 10 only, and version 11.x is compatible with Drupal 11.",
